 href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2><b>Jilong 280T All-Rounder Middle Trunk Line Fusion Splicer&nbsp;</b></h2><p>High-Performance Fiber Splicing for Trunk Line Networks</p><p>The <a href=\"/splicing-machine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jilong 280T </a>All-Rounder Middle Trunk Line Fusion Splicer is a professional-grade fiber splicing machine, designed for high-capacity backbone fiber optic networks. Built with core alignment technology, it ensures minimal splice loss, fast operation, and reliable performance in all environments.</p><h3><b>Key Features of Jilong 280T Fusion Splicer</b></h3><ul><li>Core Alignment Technology – Achieves ultra-precise fiber alignment for low splice loss</li><li>High-Speed Splicing &amp; Heating – 8 sec. quick splicing &amp; 18 sec. fast heating for maximum efficiency</li><li>User-Friendly 4.3-inch Touchscreen – Capacitive display for easy operation</li><li>Dual Camera System (320X Magnification) – Provides clear fiber visualization for accurate splicing</li><li>Smart Automatic Functions – Auto arc calibration, fiber identification &amp; splice loss estimation</li><li>Powerful 6800mAh Battery – Supports 300+ splice &amp; heat cycles per charge</li><li>Durable &amp; Compact Design – Lightweight (1.9kg), rugged construction for field use</li><li>Large Data Storage – Saves 10,000 splice records &amp; 2,000 result images</li><li>Wide Compatibility – Supports SM, MM, DS, NZDS, and G.657 fiber types</li></ul><p><br></p><h4><b>Jilong 280T Technical Specifications</b></h4><ul><li>Alignment Method: Core Alignment</li><li>Applicable Fiber Types: SM (G.652/G.657), MM (G.651), DS (G.653), NZDS (G.655)</li><li>Compatible Fiber/Cable: 0.25~3.0mm, Rubber-Insulated Fiber Cable</li><li>Fiber Cleave Length: 8-16mm</li><li>Splicing Time: 8 sec. (Quick Mode), 15 sec. (Standard Mode)</li><li>Heating Time: 18 sec. (Adjustable)</li><li>Splice Loss: SM: 0.02dB, MM: 0.01dB, DS: 0.04dB, NZDS: 0.04dB</li><li>Return Loss: &gt;60dB</li><li>Electrode Life: 5,000 arcs (extendable with grinder)</li><li>Battery: 6800mAh, supports 300+ splicing &amp; heating cycles per charge</li><li>Storage Capacity: 10,000 splice records, 2,000 images</li><li>Tension Test: 1.96~2.25N</li><li>Operating Conditions: -20°C to +50°C, 0-95% humidity, 0-5000m altitude</li><li>Weight: 1.6kg (without battery), 1.9kg (with battery)</li><li>Display: 4.3-inch capacitive touchscreen</li><li>USB 2.0 Port – For firmware updates &amp; data transfer</li></ul><p><br></p><h4><b>Why Choose the Jilong 280T Fusion Splicer?</b></h4><ul><li>Perfect for Middle Trunk Line &amp; Backbone Fiber Networks</li><li>Fastest Splicing &amp; Heating Time – Maximizes Work Efficiency</li><li>Reliable &amp; Rugged – Ideal for Harsh Environments</li><li>Large Battery Capacity – Suitable for Field Technicians</li><li>Best Price in Bangladesh (2025) – Great Value for Money</li></ul><p><br></p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  b